guage","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-06-09","description":"Must be available in English and target market language","notes":null},{"title":"Vulnerable gamblers","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-06-09","description":"RG policy should include a structured process on flagging potential vulnerable gamblers","notes":null},{"title":"Indicators of problem gambling","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-06-09","description":"Must have a structured process for responding to indicators of problem gambling","notes":null},{"title":"Player profiling and Risk Assessment","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-06-09","description":"Establish player profiles to assess risk levels","notes":null},{"title":"Monitoring and intervention","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-06-09","description":"Adopt RBA to determine level of monitoring and intervention","notes":null},{"title":"Recording RG interactions","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-06-09","description":"Record all RG interactions in PAM system","notes":null},{"title":"Identification of vulnerable persons","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-06-09","description":"Procedure to follow for players identified as vulnerable persons","notes":null},{"title":"Cooling-off period","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-06-09","description":"Operator must offer players option to activate a cooling-off period","notes":null},{"title":"Cooling-off options","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-06-09","description":"Options for cooling-off must include duration and marketing opt-out at minimum","notes":null},{"title":"Self-Exclusion","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-06-09","description":"Operator must offer players the option to self-exclude themselves for a duration of at least 1 year","notes":null},{"title":"Deposit Limits","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-06-09","description":"Players must be able to set limits on the total amount they deposit","notes":null},{"title":"Training and Staff Readiness","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-06-09","description":"Operators must train customer service and Responsible Gaming staff to handle player interaction profesionally and effectively","notes":null},{"title":"Consumer Advertising and Marketing","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-06-09","description":"Operators must not engage in irresponsible advertising","notes":null},{"title":"Internet Filtering Tools","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"Low","due":"2026-06-09","description":"The operator is advised to remind adults that they should take precautions when sharing devices with minors","notes":null},{"title":"Notifications for concerning behaviours","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"High","due":"2026-06-09","description":"Operators may employ automatic or manual pop-up notifications in response to concerning behaviours","notes":null},{"title":"Initiating direct contact","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-06-09","description":"When a player exhibits behaviour that reasonably suggests they may be a Vulnerable Player, the operator must initiate direct contact","notes":null},{"title":"Other Limits","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"High","due":"2026-06-09","description":"Other limits may be considered including loss limits, time limits or wager limits, in line wth the operator's target player and/or market","notes":null}]}]}]}